165	/****************************************************************************
166	 * Name: esp_bringup
167	 *
168	 * Description:
169	 *   Perform architecture-specific initialization.
170	 *
171	 * Input Parameters:
172	 *   None.
173	 *
174	 * Returned Value:
175	 *   Zero (OK) is returned on success; A negated errno value is returned on
176	 *   any failure.
177	 *
178	 ****************************************************************************/
